flowchart TB
    USER[Users / Analysts] --> DNS[Dynu DNS\napp.aegis-project.ddnsfree.com]
    DNS --> ALB[Internet-facing ALB\nHTTPS :443]
    ACM[ACM certificate] -. attached .-> ALB
    WAF[AWS WAF Web ACL] -. associated .-> ALB
    ALB --> ING[Kubernetes Ingress]

    subgraph VPC[AEGIS VPC 10.10.0.0/16 · us-east-1 · 2 AZs]
      subgraph EKS[Amazon EKS · private workers]
        ING --> WEB[Status-Page web replicas]
        WEB --> REVIEW[AEGIS Human Review plugin]
        RQ[RQ workers]
        SCHED[RQ scheduler\nsingleton]
        ANALYZER[AEGIS Analyzer]
        OBS[Prometheus + Grafana]
        ARGO[Argo CD]
        EXTDNS[ExternalDNS + Dynu webhook\n--dry-run]
      end

      WEB --> RDS[(RDS PostgreSQL\nMulti-AZ)]
      WEB --> REDIS[(ElastiCache Redis\nMulti-AZ / TLS)]
    end

    ANALYZER --> BEDROCK[Amazon Bedrock\nNova Pro]
    ANALYZER --> DDB[(DynamoDB findings\nPITR)]
    REVIEW --> DDB

    CW[CloudWatch\nWAF / ALB / alarms / AI quality] --> ANALYZER

    GH[GitHub Actions\nOIDC CI] --> ECR[Immutable ECR image]
    GH --> GIT[Git desired state]
    GIT --> ARGO
    ECR -. image pull .-> WEB

    EXTDNS -. exact CNAME discovery\nnon-mutating .-> DNS
